0..72 Comment "//! Corten\'s running example over THIR, its postcondition derived in the"
73..120 Comment "//! weakest-precondition calculus of `std.thir`"
121..197 Comment "//! [Farka-2026-corten_foundational_verification_rust_programs], 2026, § 4,"
198..272 Comment "//! Fig. 2: `example` returns early from inside `identity`\'s argument. The"
273..344 Comment "//! normaliser computes each precondition and the kernel replays it, so"
345..421 Comment "//! `example` meets its specification at every value and postcondition given"
422..439 Comment "//! `identity`\'s."
